### 404 → #not-found
GET {{host}}/nada
  
### 405 → link de tools.ietf.org
POST {{host}}/api/v1/weatherforecast

### 401 sin token → #unauthorized
GET {{host}}/api/v1/weatherforecast

### 200 con token
GET {{host}}/api/v1/weatherforecast
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 con token
GET {{host}}/api/v1/weatherforecast
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTenantUser}}

### Health: liveness (anónimo) → 200 Healthy
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Health: readiness (anónimo) → 200 Healthy (en F1 dependerá de Azure SQL)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Health: startup (anónimo) → 200 Healthy
GET {{host}}/health/startup


###
